      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I remember once my hand grazed nearby a character's ears and they moved to the side. I know it was just coincidental timing of their head movement with my hand but for that brief moment I felt an actual level of immersion like the character before me was more than just an image within my headset. If it was an actually implemented feature, now that would just take the cake.",
      "viewerReactions": null
